{
  "_notes": [
    "Compiled by Francis De Brabandere.",
    "Space Station (Williams 1987)",
    "https://www.ipdb.org/machine.cgi?id=2261",
    "Williams System 11B",
    "2025-03 v0.2: Tom Collins added audits",
    "2025-09 v0.4: Tom Collins added to game_state",
    "Adjustments 0x780-0x7DD are protected by an 8-bit complement sum at 0x7E5: the ROM's checksum",
    "routine (CE 07 80 4F AB 00 08 8C 07 7DE 26 F8 43 39 in sstn_u27.l5) sums from 0x780 up to but not",
    "including 0x7DE and complements it, and the ROM stores the result with STAA $07E5. Taken",
    "from the ROM; no NVRAM image was available to cross-check. A write to the block that leaves the",
    "check byte stale is answered at the next boot with a full factory reset of NVRAM (measured live",
    "on swrds_l2)."
  ],
